# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# docdoc runtime state
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local content-addressed artifact store (ADR-0003). Artifacts are immutable
# and reproducible from the pipeline; they are regenerated, never versioned.
#
# ANCHORED, and it must stay anchored. Written as a bare `artifacts/`, this rule
# also matched `src/docdoc/artifacts/` — so the entire artifacts *layer* was
# untracked, `import docdoc.pipeline` raised ModuleNotFoundError on a fresh
# clone, and the commit whose message announced that layer contained its tests
# and none of its source. A full green gate did not notice, because every check
# reads the working tree.
#
# A store lives wherever DOCDOC_STORE_ROOT points, which is an operator's
# directory rather than a path in this repository; `/artifacts/` and the two
# rules below cover the ones that could appear here. `tests/unit/test_packaging.py`
# now fails if any `src/docdoc/*` package goes missing from a built wheel, which
# is the check that would have caught this in seconds.
/artifacts/
.docdoc/
*.docdoc-cache

# Blob storage / MinIO data written by docker compose
.minio-data/
.postgres-data/

# Evaluation: keep dataset definitions and expected values, ignore generated output.
eval/predictions/
eval/reports/
eval/**/*.actual.json

# Private golden documents. Real customer documents MUST NOT enter this repo —
# see TODO(GOLDEN_DATASET_LICENSING) in the constitution.
eval/datasets/private/
eval/datasets/**/private/

# Scratch output from the CLI
out/
tmp/
*.tmp

